# Copy this file to ".env" only if you need to point the site at an API
# somewhere other than your own machine. Nothing here is a secret: everything
# starting with VITE_ is compiled into the JavaScript the browser downloads, so
# never put a password, an API key or a database URL in this file.

# Where the API lives, including the /api at the end. Leave it unset for local
# development and the site talks to http://localhost:5000/api by itself.
# Deployed, set this in the hosting dashboard (Vercel: Settings -> Environment
# Variables) to the API's public address, for example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://secureenroll-api.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=
